{"action_ordinal":4,"episode_id":"r1ep-66ac85792b572988fea562a9254baca0","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0004","observation_sha256":"89d5b726d113b3c3cf1655123c200bb8648b389ea27c42404c62135eec2994ff","ordinal":4,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":4,"episode_id":"r1ep-66ac85792b572988fea562a9254baca0","key_id":"4f8ab0809699ceaa551e45729f5f5306579caa5070bd4338e8222c5c29384163","ordinal":4,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","receipt_mac":"264871d2c466101a8851a6d658a2202bcb905b9a6bc9eb740a5dc8c1cab754f6","result_sha256":"a964a64b437c501f42d0f0b1265af2d7692bb1a1c986eb709b45350c0e56382a","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":36,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md","start_line":24},"content":"L24: Calvin: Yeah, moments like this remind me why I got into music - making a difference and sharing my own story. It's exciting to get positive feedback and it gives me strength to keep going and reach more people. My journey's just getting started!\nL25: [S18T5] (dia_id: D18:5)\nL26: \nL27: Dave: Wow, Calvin! You've come a long way since we started talking music. What's next for you? Anything exciting coming up?\nL28: [S18T6] (dia_id: D18:6)\nL29: \nL30: Calvin: Thanks Dave! Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\nL31: [S18T7] (dia_id: D18:7)\nL32: \nL33: Dave: Wow, Calvin! Congrats on the upcoming tour! Can't wait to see you perform. Do you have any cities or venues in mind?\nL34: [S18T8] (dia_id: D18:8)\nL35: \nL36: Calvin: Yay! Dave! We're hitting some awesome spots - it's gonna be epic!","content_sha256":"0253c89ef1e13b8a30dc3808fc7329a6847493efc31438d0213f67757e9865fa","coverage":[{"line_end":36,"line_start":24,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":13,"result_sha256":"a964a64b437c501f42d0f0b1265af2d7692bb1a1c986eb709b45350c0e56382a","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
