show my music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand my following!\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md:L24: Calvin: Yeah, moments like this remind me why I got into music - making a difference and sharing my own story. It's exciting to get positive feedback and it gives me strength to keep going and reach more people. My journey's just getting started!\n/memories/music-and-performance/session-19.md:L26: Dave: Wow, that's a gorgeous poster! It reminds me of one of my favorite Disney movies. I love the lesson it teaches about following your dreams no matter what others say. Have you seen it yet?","content_sha256":"3b4c011700e61100acd58f9fb4bd09f7b1020bac3d837ad7be72327f2542e775","coverage":[{"line_end":44,"line_start":44,"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-12.md"},{"line_end":36,"line_start":36,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-03.md"},{"line_end":43,"line_start":43,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-06.md"},{"line_end":24,"line_start":24,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-18.md"},{"line_end":26,"line_start":26,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-19.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":5,"result_sha256":"a27e4c8a4f977ce7d1f3443282cdd394435be89408d6b23f4c0d5281ddd72a03","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
