{"action_ordinal":19,"episode_id":"r1ep-66ac85792b572988fea562a9254baca0","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0008","observation_sha256":"288564005387538e681be9b665e9451d9214542f33b6ab899b20e9f7af4bcb60","ordinal":8,"provider_round":8,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":19,"episode_id":"r1ep-66ac85792b572988fea562a9254baca0","key_id":"4f8ab0809699ceaa551e45729f5f5306579caa5070bd4338e8222c5c29384163","ordinal":8,"provider_round":8,"question_sha256":"0cadd52a4494afb23d99f40459d0e550d51f83ba805a27440386dfe60ab71360","receipt_mac":"85ea3d0b3d59fdb49ba091d92fa87595cd50e794926b8945bf4083ac7edb8b1f","result_sha256":"389924442a678b629efb0feabc4e607dbe2c9ac04298d65ec6b12294d47b1799","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"cdefb759f83249b7cd5b9fe703c46e5be887ecde0f8a61f33260f2d8a74f6627"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":42,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-03.md","start_line":32},"content":"L32: \nL33: Dave: Wow, Calvin! It's really motivating to see you staying true to yourself. It got me thinking, where do you see your music taking you?\nL34: [S3T8] (dia_id: D3:8)\nL35: \nL36: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'm dreaming of touring the world, performing for different people and connecting with them. I hope my music can reach a global audience and make an impact. I'm also looking forward to my upcoming trip to Boston after I finish the Frank Ocean tour. I've heard that the music scene there is awesome, so I can't wait to check it out!\nL37: [S3T9] (dia_id: D3:9)\nL38: \nL39: Dave: Sounds like an amazing plan, Cal! I can't wait for your trip to Boston. I'll show you around town and all the cool spots. The music scene there is awesome, with places like Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park. You'll definitely have some great performances there. Count me in for the front row when you're up onstage! Oh, and by the way, check out this pic.\nL40: [Image caption: a photography of a city skyline with a boat in the water]\nL41: [S3T10] (dia_id: D3:10)\nL42: ","content_sha256":"b7eae83104d6a6127ab8c8d392bd2500dbdc25d06bdcf1ed382c9487519d09ed","coverage":[{"line_end":42,"line_start":32,"path":"/memories/music-and-performance/session-03.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":11,"result_sha256":"389924442a678b629efb0feabc4e607dbe2c9ac04298d65ec6b12294d47b1799","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d"}
